  choices = $EXPL$["$28,000, which is 100% of prior-year tax when AGI is $150,000 or less","$30,800, which is 110% of prior-year tax under the higher-income threshold","$37,800, which is 90% of the current-year tax liability amount","$42,000, which is 100% of the current-year tax liability amount"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 6654(d)(1)(B), the prior-year safe harbor requires payment of 100% of prior-year tax liability when prior-year AGI is $150,000 or less. Reed''s prior-year AGI of $140,000 is below the threshold, so he must pay $28,000 to avoid the penalty.
