  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 6654(e)(2), no underpayment penalty applies if the taxpayer had zero tax liability in the prior year and was a U.S. citizen or resident for the entire year. This is an automatic exemption regardless of current-year tax owed.
